{"3929840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Extinction Core-2005", "steam_appid": 3929840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/c686d5a64445a18ac4bc3858fc5b3cd5.avif?t=1766398452\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXTINCTION CORE-2005</strong> is a relentless bullet-hell where weaponizing kaiju keeps you alive—at the cost of your humanity and the world’s color<br>Repeated possessions twist your aircraft and mind, slowly corrupting the battlefield into a glitching black-and-white void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/849f8793281192059368c8ba984b8736.poster.avif?t=1766398452\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/849f8793281192059368c8ba984b8736.webm?t=1766398452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/849f8793281192059368c8ba984b8736.mp4?t=1766398452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated possessions twist your aircraft and mind, slowly corrupting the battlefield into a glitching black-and-white void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/3a8be893d560efb0287bdbda4f21828b.poster.avif?t=1766398452\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929840/extras/3a8be893d560efb0287bdbda4f21828b.webm?t=176639